sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Browser)
    participant A as Authenticator
    participant S as Server

    C->>S: 1. POST /auth/start
    Note over S: Generate & store challenge
    S-->>C: 2. Return challenge + options

    C->>A: 3. navigator.credentials.get()
    Note over A: Verify user (fingerprint/face)
    Note over A: Sign challenge with private key
    A-->>C: 4. Return signed assertion

    C->>S: 5. POST /auth/verify (assertion)
    Note over S: Verify signature with stored public key
    Note over S: Create session
    S-->>C: 6. Set session cookie
